    note: `A capability and credentials site of up to 100 pages starts from ${P.site}. A technical catalogue where every size, material and standard combination gets its own indexable page starts from ${P.seoSite}. An enquiry or estimating system with logins starts from ${P.software}, field data capture on Android from ${P.app}, and an online store from ${P.shop}, which almost no Mussafah fabricator needs. What moves the number on this kind of project is rarely the page count. It is how scattered your credentials are at the start, how many disciplines need their own capability page, whether the RFQ form has to integrate with anything, and whether the technical content has to be written from interviews rather than supplied. Everything is quoted as a line in USD, nothing is billed before you approve the quote in writing, and the rate comparison is on <a href='/uae/web-developer-for-abu-dhabi-businesses/'>hiring a web developer for an Abu Dhabi business</a>.`,
